@baseUrl = http://localhost:18080
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_APPROVED_USER_JWT_TOKEN
@serverId = 1
@pendingUserId = REPLACE_WITH_PENDING_USER_ID
@expectedFingerprint = SHA256:REPLACEWITHTRUSTEDBASE64FINGERPRINT
@monitorTicket = REPLACE_WITH_ONE_TIME_MONITOR_TICKET

### System: health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
X-Correlation-ID: local-health-request

### System: ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ready
X-Correlation-ID: local-ready-request

### Auth: bootstrap status（公开端点：true 表示注册需携带一次性初始化令牌）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/bootstrap-status
X-Correlation-ID: local-bootstrap-status-request

### Auth: register first admin or normal user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-register-request

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD"
}

### Auth: register first admin while bootstrap pending（批次 8：待初始化实例须携带令牌，
### 取值见服务器启动横幅或 AUTH_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN 预置，32-128 字符，成功后立即失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-register-bootstrap-request

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD",
  "bootstrapToken": "REPLACE_WITH_ONE_TIME_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN"
}

### Auth: login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-login-request

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD"
}

### Auth: current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-current-user-request

### Auth: logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-logout-request

### Admin: pending users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-admin-pending-users

### Admin: approve user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{pendingUserId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-admin-approve-user

### Admin: reject user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/{{pendingUserId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-admin-reject-user

### Servers: list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers?page=1&page_size=20&keyword=&sort_by=id&sort_order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-server-list

### Servers: create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-server-create-password

{
  "name": "local-server",
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "description": "Local development server",
  "ssh_host": "127.0.0.1",
  "ssh_port": 22,
  "ssh_user": "REPLACE_WITH_SSH_USER",
  "ssh_auth_type": "password",
  "ssh_password": "REPLACE_WITH_SSH_PASSWORD"
}

### Servers: create with private key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-server-create-private-key

{
  "name": "private-key-server",
  "host": "SERVER_IP_OR_DOMAIN",
  "description": "Private key authentication example",
  "ssh_host": "SERVER_IP_OR_DOMAIN",
  "ssh_port": 22,
  "ssh_user": "REPLACE_WITH_SSH_USER",
  "ssh_auth_type": "private_key",
  "ssh_private_key": "REPLACE_WITH_PRIVATE_KEY",
  "ssh_private_key_passphrase": "REPLACE_WITH_OPTIONAL_PASSPHRASE"
}

### Servers: detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-server-detail

### Servers: update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-server-update

{
  "name": "local-server",
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "description": "Updated local development server",
  "ssh_host": "127.0.0.1",
  "ssh_port": 22,
  "ssh_user": "REPLACE_WITH_SSH_USER",
  "ssh_auth_type": "password"
}

### Servers: status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-server-status

### Servers: delete soft
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-server-delete

### SSH: confirm host key for the first time or review it unchanged
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/ssh/host-key
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-ssh-host-key-confirm

{
  "expected_fingerprint": "{{expectedFingerprint}}",
  "replace": false
}

### SSH: explicitly confirm a trusted host key rotation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/ssh/host-key
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-ssh-host-key-rotate

{
  "expected_fingerprint": "{{expectedFingerprint}}",
  "replace": true
}

### SSH: test stored credential against the registered host key (no request body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/ssh/test
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-ssh-connection-test

### Agent: register one-time token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/agent/register
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-agent-register

### Agent: rotate token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/agent/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-agent-rotate

### Agent: revoke token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/agent/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-agent-revoke

### Monitor: request one-time WebSocket ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ws/monitor-ticket
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-monitor-ticket

# 使用响应 data.ticket 建立：
# ws://SERVER_IP_OR_DOMAIN/ws/monitor?ticket={{monitorTicket}}
# 首帧示例：{"type":"metrics.subscribe","message_id":"REPLACE_WITH_UUID","timestamp":"2026-07-21T12:00:00Z","payload":{"server_id":1}}

# Agent 使用 data.agent_token 建立 ws://SERVER_IP_OR_DOMAIN/ws/agent；
# Token 只放在 agent.authenticate 首帧 payload 中，不进入 URL、日志或版本控制文件。
# metrics.report 示例：{"type":"metrics.report","message_id":"REPLACE_WITH_UUID","timestamp":"2026-07-25T12:00:00Z","payload":{"server_id":1,"collected_at":"2026-07-25T12:00:00Z","cpu_percent":35.2}}
# 重试同一采样时必须复用原 message_id。message_id 重复会静默幂等；采样时间不严格递增会收到 error 40002。

### Metrics: latest fixed-width snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/metrics/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-metrics-latest

### Metrics: fixed-width history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/servers/{{serverId}}/metrics?start_time=2026-07-21T00:00:00Z&end_time=2026-07-21T23:59:59Z&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-metrics-history

### Alerts: create rule (admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-alert-create-rule

{
  "server_id": 1,
  "metric": "cpu",
  "operator": ">",
  "threshold_value": 80,
  "level": "warning"
}

### Alerts: create general rule (null server_id matches all servers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-alert-create-general-rule

{
  "metric": "memory",
  "operator": ">=",
  "threshold_value": 90,
  "level": "critical"
}

### Alerts: list rules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-alert-list-rules

### Alerts: update rule
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/rules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: local-alert-update-rule

{
  "threshold_value": 90,
  "level": "critical",
  "enabled": true
}

### Alerts: delete rule (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/rules/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-alert-delete-rule

### Alerts: list records (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/records?server_id=1&status=unread&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-alert-list-records

### Alerts: mark record as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/records/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-Correlation-ID: local-alert-mark-read
